        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="072f-7f4a-18eb-925e">A Legion Predator must select either a TL Lascannon OR Predator Cannon OR Flamestorm Cannon. A Legion Predator must also select either Heavy Bolters OR Lascannons OR Heavy Flamers for its side sponsons. Heavy Flamers and Heavy Bolters convey a FF value of 3+. You must select all weapon options before the start of the game.</characteristic>
